OL,3,CFarage says football club visit
OL,4,Ccontroversy was 'nonsense'
OL,6,FNigel Farage has labelled the backlash
OL,7,Fto his controversial visit to a
OL,8,FChampionship football club as
OL,9,F"ridiculous".
OL,11,FThe Reform UK leader was pictured at
OL,12,FIpswich Town's Portman Road stadium
OL,13,Flast week holding up club shirts with
OL,14,F"Farage 10" on the back.
OL,16,FAfter the party's social media posts
OL,17,Fsparked anger amongst a section of
OL,18,FTown fans, the club's chief executive
OL,19,Fwas forced to apologise for any "harm
OL,20,Fand distress" caused by the visit.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/6
