OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F310A1775419426
OL,3,CFarage says football club visit
OL,4,Ccontroversy was 'nonsense'
OL,6,FOn Tuesday, the Clacton MP was in
OL,7,FNorfolk for Reform's local election
OL,8,Fcampaign and told ITV News Anglia:
OL,9,F"That was just ridiculous wasn't it?
OL,11,F"It's funny isn't it? Keir Starmer can
OL,12,Fvisit football clubs - that's fine.
OL,13,FOther politicians - it's fine.
OL,15,F"I do it, and you get the hate mob
OL,16,Fonline and everyone runs scared. It's
OL,17,Fnonsense."
OL,26,@sD@AOUyD@JO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/6
