CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F310A1775419426
OL,3,CFarage says football club visit
OL,4,Ccontroversy was 'nonsense'
OL,6,FFarage added that he was not deterred
OL,7,Fby the fiasco and wanted to visit
OL,8,F"every football club" to talk about
OL,9,Fplans for a new regulator for English
OL,10,Ffootball.
OL,12,FSome Ipswich fans said they did not
OL,13,Fwant the club associated with Farage's
OL,14,Fpolitical views.
OL,16,FMembers of the local media called for
OL,17,Fthe club to say sorry - with the East
OL,18,FAnglian Daily Times calling for a club
OL,19,Fapology.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/6
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
