FL,311,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31004
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F310A1775419426
OL,3,CFarage says football club visit
OL,4,Ccontroversy was 'nonsense'
OL,6,F"One wonders how the club's sponsors `
OL,7,Fmany emblazoned on the advertising
OL,8,Fboard behind him ` felt about being
OL,9,Fassociated with a man as divisive as
OL,10,FFarage," the article read.
OL,12,F"Or how the club's players and staff
OL,13,Ffelt when they saw a politician linked
OL,14,Fwith allegations of racism, homophobia
OL,15,Fand misogyny holding their famous
OL,16,Fshirt aloft."
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/6
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
