PN,31005
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F310A1775419426
OL,3,CFarage says football club visit
OL,4,Ccontroversy was 'nonsense'
OL,6,FA report in The Athletic suggested
OL,7,Fthat they'd seen proof that Farage had
OL,8,Fbeen invited and had received the
OL,9,Fshirts as gifts - an accusation
OL,10,FIpswich haven't commented on.
OL,12,FOn Friday, Ipswich Town chairman and
OL,13,Fchief executive Mark Ashton admitted
OL,14,Fin an in-house club interview that the
OL,15,Fvisit had caused "harm and distress".
OL,17,F"The staff are hurting, elements of
OL,18,Fthe fanbase are hurting, and so are
OL,19,Felements of our local community ` and
OL,20,Fthat upsets me immensely," said Ashton.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/6
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat SportCNat Radio FWeather
FL,311,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31006
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F310A1775419426
OL,3,CFarage says football club visit
OL,4,Ccontroversy was 'nonsense'
OL,6,F"For that, I want to unreservedly
OL,7,Fapologise and say I'm sorry."
OL,9,FAshton went on to say that "lessons
OL,10,Fhad been learned" from the visit - but
OL,11,Falso suggested that there were a "lot
OL,12,Fof mistruths out there" about how it
OL,13,Fmaterialised.
